    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>An extended heat sink and thermal clip assembly that increases the number of rounds a weapon can fire before requiring a heat sink swap. The larger thermal mass absorbs more heat per cycle, allowing the weapon to sustain fire well past the point a standard configuration would demand a reload. Compatible with any ranged weapon. Increases the weapon's ammo capacity by 50% (round up).</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> - Install on weapon during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p><hr/><p><em>Installation: Drag it onto a weapon in your inventory to install it. It affects only that weapon. This weapon's ammo capacity rises by half, rounded up.</em></p>"
